{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-01_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-01","title":"龙门之行","storyCode":"2-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"816bf7903d3130eb5200cc98de192e1bca3465d617ff76fa0dde3f387e36ab58","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"龙门5区检疫口，博士一行与龙门近卫局的陈会面。\n在陈的带领下，几人踏入龙门首脑魏彦吾的办公室，而在那里，谈判已经开始。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:14 p.m. \\ 晴 \\ 能见度 19公里\n龙门5区外 检疫口"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他们来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请注意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受天灾影响，龙门全域处于停航状态。龙门5区所有入城关口将于2小时后关闭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请积极配合工作人员进行矿石病检疫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一旦发现任何未经登记的感染者，请广大市民立刻向最近的警员通报，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局将依照《紧急处理法案》依法对其进行拘捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请注意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"和传闻中一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛与近卫局约好在十点见面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是十点十四。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们迟到了十四分钟，无谓地浪费了我十四分钟时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，陈长官，这片区域刚才有整合————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我知道。不过这些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——这个人是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}是罗德岛的顾问。凯尔希医生应该通知过龙门的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，人已经到齐，现在你们需要跟我去见——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官！不好了！不好——感染者——那又——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"慌什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一队，戒备！狙击队员，就位！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发生，发生什么了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......怎么回事，汇报情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我过去！！为什么要抓我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是怪物！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"有感染者——不服从管理——我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己都看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们全部拘押。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻疏散人群，半小时后通过复查流程后，再开放关口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，把检疫口检查线向前推四十米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的，除了你和Dr.{@nickname}，其他人不需要一起同行，留在这里协助龙门边防进行驻守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要是连这点小事都处理不好，无论是什么任务，我可都没法交给你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"PC94172，你给这些人安排一下任务，今晚不要再出乱子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，陈警司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位，请注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（陈长官真的很严格......比我想象的要严格......）"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......（点头）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来。——"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好高的建筑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对，对不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——罗德岛的身手还算不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢陈长官夸奖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格事件发生之后，什么人都疯了一样地向龙门跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者就该清楚，来龙门会有什么下场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我再提醒你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龙门就是下一个切尔诺伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是凯尔希医生......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们罗德岛的代表已经和魏长官先行接触了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里等着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我一会儿通知你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那个陈警官，真的很难应付呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，接下来的交涉就交给凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信她吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["？？？","陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["？？？","近卫局队员"]}]}
